WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:04.977
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:05.247 --> 01:08.528
[Episode 2]

3
01:08.528 --> 01:10.140
Just a signature...

4
01:26.840 --> 01:28.760
You dared to slap me?

5
01:28.760 --> 01:30.739
Yes, I did!

6
01:31.840 --> 01:33.640
I seem rough

7
01:33.640 --> 01:35.799
because I butcher and sell meat for my father.

8
01:35.799 --> 01:37.280
That street's mixed.

9
01:37.280 --> 01:38.325
If I weren't tough,

10
01:38.325 --> 01:40.239
I'd have been pushed around by thugs.

11
01:40.239 --> 01:42.420
How could you look down on me?

12
01:46.373 --> 01:49.173
You mock my gaudy clothes and act so high and mighty,

13
01:49.173 --> 01:50.959
but everything I wear

14
01:50.959 --> 01:53.219
was earned with my own hands!

15
01:55.760 --> 01:58.079
You can't carry anything or lift a finger.

16
01:58.079 --> 01:59.719
You were born rich and spoiled.

17
01:59.719 --> 02:02.006
How could you look down on me?

18
02:03.439 --> 02:04.680
You mock my illiteracy.

19
02:04.680 --> 02:06.560
It's because I had to run the house.

20
02:06.560 --> 02:09.280
I had neither the time nor the money to study!

21
02:09.280 --> 02:11.400
It's not that I didn't want to.

22
02:11.400 --> 02:13.419
I couldn't, and I resent it.

23
02:14.199 --> 02:16.740
How could you look down on me?

24
02:23.159 --> 02:25.680
Did I choose to be crude, vulgar,

25
02:25.680 --> 02:28.699
or illiterate just so you could look down on me?

26
02:33.319 --> 02:36.520
I've long heard you're a scholar of Yangzhou,

27
02:36.520 --> 02:38.838
well-versed in all state affairs.

28
02:38.838 --> 02:41.339
But you only see the sky and ignore the earth.

29
02:41.339 --> 02:44.699
Do you even deserve to be called a scholar, or even a man?

30
02:56.611 --> 02:58.481
I've said my piece.

31
02:58.481 --> 03:01.057
Divorce me if you want. It's fine.

32
03:01.057 --> 03:02.938
I can take back my betrothal gifts

33
03:02.938 --> 03:05.000
before anyone else benefits.

34
03:05.000 --> 03:07.759
I thought I'd made a good match,

35
03:07.759 --> 03:10.680
but I must've been blinded,

36
03:10.680 --> 03:14.139
blessed with the worst luck ever to marry a worthless man.

37
03:37.918 --> 03:39.842
What about you?

38
03:39.842 --> 03:42.460
How much do you know about my situation?

39
03:44.919 --> 03:47.840
Why are my legs crippled? Why am I not going home?

40
03:47.840 --> 03:49.740
Why did I marry you?

41
03:51.128 --> 03:54.639
In a prominent family full of schemes and prowling wolves,

42
03:54.639 --> 03:57.560
you think it was bad luck, youthful folly, or coincidence.

43
03:57.560 --> 04:00.539
In fact, it was a bloody path plotted and paved by others.

44
04:01.520 --> 04:03.740
How could you hit me?

45
04:12.080 --> 04:14.000
Fine.

46
04:14.000 --> 04:15.860
Why not stay here?

47
04:20.800 --> 04:23.699
You can leave after they strip you to the bone.

48
04:39.920 --> 04:43.639
You... You scoundrel!

49
04:43.639 --> 04:46.339
- Keep going! - Fine, I will!

50
04:48.734 --> 04:50.234
Smash it!

51
05:00.233 --> 05:03.560
50 taels. 127 taels.

52
05:03.560 --> 05:09.459
263 taels. 1,558 taels. In total...

53
05:11.279 --> 05:13.139
1,998 taels.

54
05:18.040 --> 05:21.240
Butchering pigs daily nets me 120 wen.

55
05:21.240 --> 05:24.800
That's 3 taels and 6 mace a month, and 43 taels and 8 mace a year.

56
05:24.800 --> 05:27.079
To pay back this 1,998 taels,

57
05:27.079 --> 05:29.600
it'd take 16,650 days without eating or drinking.

58
05:29.600 --> 05:32.120
That's 45 years?

59
05:32.120 --> 05:34.600
You smashed precious antiques in my residence,

60
05:34.600 --> 05:38.279
causing a loss of 1,998 taels.

61
05:38.279 --> 05:39.920
Since you have no money to pay,

62
05:39.920 --> 05:44.959
you'll stay in the Xie family to attend to me at my command.

63
05:44.959 --> 05:47.519
Laundry, sweeping, serving tea, and fetching water.

64
05:47.519 --> 05:49.839
All heavy chores will be done by you.

65
05:49.839 --> 05:52.040
You will obey every order in the manor,

66
05:52.040 --> 05:55.627
working like a beast of burden to repay your debt.

67
05:55.627 --> 05:57.259
Serve three years.

68
05:58.079 --> 06:00.489
Debt paid, and you are free.

69
06:00.489 --> 06:01.989
Will you sign,

70
06:03.800 --> 06:05.420
or not?

71
06:14.352 --> 06:15.720
[Labor Debt Agreement]

72
06:15.720 --> 06:17.354
Fine, I'll sign.

73
06:17.354 --> 06:19.279
What's there to be smug about?

74
06:19.279 --> 06:22.980
666 taels a year. Who knows who's really getting the raw deal?

75
06:39.920 --> 06:41.439
This better be important.

76
06:41.439 --> 06:44.394
Why do you get a bed and I'm on the floor?

77
06:44.394 --> 06:47.311
- A husband is the guide to his wife. - What's that supposed to mean?

78
06:47.311 --> 06:50.040
A woman must obey her husband.

79
06:50.040 --> 06:51.415
Who said that?

80
06:51.415 --> 06:52.805
Dong Zhong Shu.

81
06:52.805 --> 06:54.420
What did Aunt Dong say?

82
06:55.639 --> 06:56.920
Not the "Shu" as in "uncle."

83
06:56.920 --> 06:58.279
Then which "Shu" is it?

84
06:58.279 --> 07:00.379
The "Shu" as in "comfort."

85
07:02.800 --> 07:04.920
Laozi said a wife is the guide to her husband!

86
07:04.920 --> 07:06.360
When did Laozi say that?

87
07:06.360 --> 07:09.720
Not that Laozi. It's me, standing right in front of you!

88
07:09.720 --> 07:10.720
Hand it over.

89
07:10.720 --> 07:12.160
- Why? - Hand it over.

90
07:12.160 --> 07:13.639
No!

91
07:13.639 --> 07:14.639
Give it to me.

92
07:14.639 --> 07:15.839
No!

93
07:15.839 --> 07:17.339
Give it to me!

94
07:25.113 --> 07:26.939
You...

95
07:41.040 --> 07:42.699
Jin Bao Zhu!

96
07:43.920 --> 07:45.899
Get out!

97
07:55.360 --> 07:57.560
Exploiting my gains,

98
07:57.560 --> 08:01.100
humiliating my body, and ruining my reputation...

99
08:02.120 --> 08:04.740
Human greed truly knows no bounds.

100
09:06.759 --> 09:09.519
- Quick, put it away. - Yes.

101
09:09.519 --> 09:11.019
All set. Let's go.

102
09:18.200 --> 09:19.519
These two look nice, too.

103
09:19.519 --> 09:20.639
Put them in my hair.

104
09:20.639 --> 09:22.139
Yes.

105
09:24.720 --> 09:26.399
Lady Jin, your makeup is done.

106
09:26.399 --> 09:27.840
If anything is not right,

107
09:27.840 --> 09:29.679
just let us know, Lady Jin.

108
09:29.679 --> 09:30.799
No.

109
09:30.799 --> 09:32.299
I'm very pleased.

110
09:44.559 --> 09:47.080
I wondered what vase came to life.

111
09:47.080 --> 09:48.399
Turns out it's a person.

112
09:48.399 --> 09:51.559
Why not plant a whole garden on your head to save the trouble?

113
09:51.559 --> 09:54.360
Better to wear flowers on my head than ice on your face.

114
09:54.360 --> 09:55.960
Mind your own business.

115
09:55.960 --> 09:57.600
Instead of preening yourself,

116
09:57.600 --> 09:59.799
come serve my meal.

117
09:59.799 --> 10:01.120
Serve your meal?

118
10:01.120 --> 10:02.159
Why should I do that?

119
10:02.159 --> 10:04.320
Are you handless?

120
10:04.320 --> 10:06.879
Heavens, what a pity!

121
10:06.879 --> 10:08.639
Loaded with wealth,

122
10:08.639 --> 10:11.220
even the handless are served.

123
10:12.120 --> 10:14.320
Being dull and forgetful,

124
10:14.320 --> 10:17.279
no amount of gold can make up for it.

125
10:17.279 --> 10:19.320
[Contractor: Xie Yan] Tell me,

126
10:19.320 --> 10:20.879
[Debtor in Service: Jin Bao Zhu] who's more pitiful?

127
10:20.879 --> 10:22.519
Fine, I'll sign.

128
10:22.519 --> 10:24.120
[Labor Debt Agreement] What's there to be smug about?

129
10:24.120 --> 10:27.980
666 taels a year. Who knows who's really getting the raw deal?

130
10:29.419 --> 10:30.879
Jian Wei.

131
10:30.879 --> 10:32.379
Serve the dishes.

132
11:21.240 --> 11:22.740
This one.

133
11:31.960 --> 11:34.879
How do you know you're not the one losing out more?

134
11:34.879 --> 11:36.519
A loss may bring good fortune.

135
11:36.519 --> 11:39.779
Then allow me to wish you boundless fortune.

136
12:01.182 --> 12:03.533
We need to serve tea later.

137
12:03.533 --> 12:05.521
What's taking so long?

138
12:05.521 --> 12:08.899
How come there isn't a speck of meat in your food?

139
12:10.181 --> 12:12.320
All style and no substance.

140
12:12.320 --> 12:13.759
Looks so grand,

141
12:13.759 --> 12:17.299
but it's just vegetarian chicken, pickles, and plain tofu.

142
12:31.160 --> 12:32.240
What is your problem?

143
12:32.240 --> 12:33.600
I served with care,

144
12:33.600 --> 12:35.539
and you're leaving already?

145
12:36.919 --> 12:39.440
Go explain the rules to her.

146
12:39.440 --> 12:40.940
Yes, Master Yan.

147
12:43.840 --> 12:44.840
Forgive me, Lady Jin.

148
12:44.840 --> 12:47.759
Amid the morning rush, I forgot to tell you the rules here.

149
12:47.759 --> 12:51.338
Master Yan was injured riding a horse long ago.

150
12:51.338 --> 12:53.759
But he has a good heart. No need to fear him.

151
12:53.759 --> 12:56.607
Just be mindful of what you say in front of him.

152
12:56.607 --> 12:58.639
Anything...

153
12:58.639 --> 12:59.799
related to it.

154
12:59.799 --> 13:02.240
- For instance... - Wait.

155
13:02.240 --> 13:03.799
Running, jumping, kicking, leaping?

156
13:03.799 --> 13:04.799
- Don't say it! - When we were eating just now,

157
13:04.799 --> 13:06.076
I didn't say any of that.

158
13:06.076 --> 13:07.639
Why did he lose his temper?

159
13:07.639 --> 13:08.840
You might not know,

160
13:08.840 --> 13:09.860
[Facade Allowance] monthly stipends are divided

161
13:09.860 --> 13:11.440
[Issued by the household based on rank] into facade and substance allowances.

162
13:11.440 --> 13:12.800
[Strictly for attire, jewelry, and carriages to uphold the family's prestige]

163
13:12.800 --> 13:13.974
[Substance Allowance: A 50% cut from the month's grain transport profits]

164
13:13.974 --> 13:15.043
[Reserved for private use like food, linens, and undergarments]

165
13:15.043 --> 13:17.736
For private use on undergarments.

166
13:17.736 --> 13:19.039
I understand now.

167
13:19.039 --> 13:22.480
Master Yan is crippled and can't earn this substance allowance,

168
13:22.480 --> 13:24.240
so naturally, the table is bare.

169
13:24.240 --> 13:26.919
When I brought it up, he got hopping mad.

170
13:26.919 --> 13:28.894
He's useless, yet faults my loose tongue.

171
13:28.894 --> 13:30.559
If you ask me, just give up the opium.

172
13:30.559 --> 13:31.840
What opium?

173
13:31.840 --> 13:33.799
Master Yan never touches that poison.

174
13:33.799 --> 13:35.559
He's still in pain,

175
13:35.559 --> 13:37.360
and hates the bitter medicine.

176
13:37.360 --> 13:38.759
Lady Qin went to great lengths

177
13:38.759 --> 13:40.440
to get this powder for the pain.

178
13:40.440 --> 13:43.639
What? He's picky even about taking medicine?

179
13:43.639 --> 13:45.639
Darn his legs! He thinks he's the Emperor?

180
13:45.639 --> 13:48.360
My lady. My lady, I beg you!

181
13:48.360 --> 13:50.679
Never say that again!

182
13:50.679 --> 13:52.639
- Please... - What if I insist on saying "leg"?

183
13:52.639 --> 13:54.000
Then say "shank".

184
13:54.000 --> 13:56.679
Shanks means the same thing.

185
13:56.679 --> 13:58.360
Darn his shank!

186
13:58.360 --> 14:01.440
None of you are officials, yet you put on such grand airs.

187
14:01.440 --> 14:03.159
Our master used to be

188
14:03.159 --> 14:05.240
the Director of the Canal Shipping Bureau.

189
14:05.240 --> 14:06.980
- It's just that later, he... - Jian Wei.

190
14:14.000 --> 14:15.879
Weren't you taking me to serve tea?

191
14:15.879 --> 14:17.820
At least tell me who's there.

192
14:29.759 --> 14:32.080
At the head is my grandmother.

193
14:32.080 --> 14:34.360
All major family decisions rest with her.

194
14:34.360 --> 14:38.000
But she has a morning pulse check, so she'll be a bit late.

195
14:38.000 --> 14:40.240
[Zhou Wan Jun, Mistress of the Xie Family] Sitting in the seat of honor is my mother.

196
14:40.240 --> 14:42.080
[Wife of the Second Master] She is frail in health and gentle by nature.

197
14:42.080 --> 14:44.779
This concubine, Jin Bao Zhu, greets Madam.

198
14:45.519 --> 14:47.019
Good.

199
14:52.600 --> 14:54.480
Greetings, Madam Shen.

200
14:54.480 --> 14:56.200
[Shen Man Yun] On the left is my eldest uncle's wife.

201
14:56.200 --> 14:58.019
[Wife of the Eldest Master] She's always been outspoken.

202
14:59.200 --> 15:00.559
Greetings, Lady Lin.

203
15:00.559 --> 15:02.159
Sitting below her on the outside

204
15:02.159 --> 15:03.679
[Lin Chan Yue] is my eldest uncle's concubine.

205
15:03.679 --> 15:05.620
[Concubine of the Eldest Master] She is usually a woman of few words.

206
15:07.120 --> 15:09.960
- Greetings, Lady Qin. - On the right is Lady Qin.

207
15:09.960 --> 15:12.720
She currently manages the household and is eloquent.

208
15:12.720 --> 15:14.159
[Qin Ke Han] When you deal with her,

209
15:14.159 --> 15:15.159
[Concubine of the Second Master] remember to keep your guard up.

210
15:15.159 --> 15:18.559
That day, my eyes didn't deceive me after all.

211
15:18.559 --> 15:20.559
Dressed up like this,

212
15:20.559 --> 15:22.940
you truly are a natural beauty.

213
15:29.320 --> 15:32.919
Debts demand repayment!

214
15:32.919 --> 15:34.440
- So early in the morning, - Debts

215
15:34.440 --> 15:36.259
- who is making such a racket? - demand repayment!

216
15:37.039 --> 15:38.399
Nothing.

217
15:38.399 --> 15:40.559
Someone came causing trouble this morning,

218
15:40.559 --> 15:43.360
claiming Yan owes a huge debt.

219
15:43.360 --> 15:44.919
I thought he's well-behaved.

220
15:44.919 --> 15:47.320
How could he do something so reckless?

221
15:47.320 --> 15:49.519
Some outsider's making it up to scam money.

222
15:49.519 --> 15:51.200
I had him driven out,

223
15:51.200 --> 15:54.840
but he's still loitering outside, refusing to leave.

224
15:54.840 --> 15:57.720
You owe money, so you should... Let go of me!

225
15:57.720 --> 15:58.919
- Shut up! - Let me go!

226
15:58.919 --> 16:00.419
Let him go.

227
16:03.240 --> 16:06.000
Greetings, Madam.

228
16:06.000 --> 16:09.559
All the ladies in charge, I'm a clerk from Shuyu Pavilion.

229
16:09.559 --> 16:11.700
I came to collect a debt today.

230
16:12.559 --> 16:14.639
The ledger is right here.

231
16:14.639 --> 16:16.679
A prominent family like yours

232
16:16.679 --> 16:19.519
surely wouldn't be more shameless

233
16:19.519 --> 16:21.639
than street thugs, would you?

234
16:21.639 --> 16:23.080
Watch your mouth!

235
16:23.080 --> 16:24.580
Ming Pei.

236
16:39.303 --> 16:44.279
Lady Jin, Lady Qin has always been full of praise for you,

237
16:44.279 --> 16:47.679
saying you're sharp-witted and great with numbers.

238
16:47.679 --> 16:51.120
Since you're right here today and this concerns Yan,

239
16:51.120 --> 16:54.580
would you be so kind as to look it over carefully?

240
17:14.960 --> 17:16.460
Mama.

241
17:20.200 --> 17:22.319
The plum blossoms are so beautiful.

242
17:22.319 --> 17:24.660
I got you a few branches. Look!

243
17:29.079 --> 17:30.619
Good morning, Madam.

244
17:32.079 --> 17:33.759
[Xie Qiao, Fifth Young Master of Xie Family] Are you feeling better today?

245
17:33.759 --> 17:35.660
[Son of Qin Ke Han] Same as usual.

246
17:36.559 --> 17:39.440
These blossoms are truly delightful to look at.

247
17:39.440 --> 17:43.839
Once I'm feeling well enough, I'll go out and have a look too.

248
17:43.839 --> 17:47.559
[Xie Xi, Third Daughter of the Xie Family] Madam, the plum blossoms here are lovely,

249
17:47.559 --> 17:48.960
[Daughter of Qin Ke Han] just like you.

250
17:48.960 --> 17:52.160
Seemingly delicate, yet more resilient to the cold than others,

251
17:52.160 --> 17:54.059
not fearing the chill.

252
17:56.359 --> 17:58.799
You always know just what to say.

253
17:58.799 --> 18:03.000
All right then, I'll pick some well-shaped branches

254
18:03.000 --> 18:05.160
and put them in that celadon vase.

255
18:05.160 --> 18:07.799
It'll liven up the room.

256
18:07.799 --> 18:09.299
Here.

257
18:12.200 --> 18:13.700
Come.

258
18:14.880 --> 18:16.420
Let me see.

259
18:22.920 --> 18:26.339
Lady Jin, how does it look?

260
18:26.960 --> 18:29.900
Is what the clerk from Shuyu Pavilion said true?

261
18:31.839 --> 18:33.839
Lady Qin,

262
18:33.839 --> 18:37.519
I just came here and don't know much yet.

263
18:37.519 --> 18:39.019
Master Yan,

264
18:39.799 --> 18:42.019
do you owe Shuyu Pavilion money?

265
18:42.720 --> 18:45.779
I've taken goods on credit, more than once.

266
18:45.779 --> 18:48.720
Then this won't be settled in just a few minutes.

267
18:48.720 --> 18:51.279
Sir, may I know how much he owes?

268
18:51.279 --> 18:53.319
From mid-year until now,

269
18:53.319 --> 18:57.980
it comes to 1,879 taels and 6 mace.

270
19:04.319 --> 19:07.079
That means calculated over six months,

271
19:07.079 --> 19:11.500
he'd have to owe 313 taels, 2 mace, and 7 fen each month.

272
19:14.599 --> 19:18.440
That... That's enough for an ordinary family for 40 or 50 years!

273
19:18.440 --> 19:20.759
This won't do! We can't keep this hidden!

274
19:20.759 --> 19:22.920
Die Huan, go inform the Matriarch.

275
19:22.920 --> 19:24.420
Wait.

276
19:27.960 --> 19:30.559
The matter hasn't been settled yet.

277
19:30.559 --> 19:33.240
Why are you in such a rush to inform the Matriarch?

278
19:33.240 --> 19:36.000
Besides, if it's true,

279
19:36.000 --> 19:38.960
I can just use my dowry to cover the deficit.

280
19:38.960 --> 19:41.039
Why bring it to the Matriarch?

281
19:41.039 --> 19:44.740
She's having her pulse checked right now.

282
19:47.000 --> 19:48.559
You're right.

283
19:48.559 --> 19:50.859
My concern gets the better of me.

284
19:54.680 --> 19:56.200
I had no choice.

285
19:56.200 --> 19:57.680
I manage the household.

286
19:57.680 --> 19:59.119
Cheng Zong is away running the boats.

287
19:59.119 --> 20:02.480
If anything goes wrong, I can't take the blame,

288
20:02.480 --> 20:04.599
nor can I keep it hidden.

289
20:04.599 --> 20:06.394
No need to hide it.

290
20:06.394 --> 20:07.980
Just beat me to death.

291
20:08.799 --> 20:11.680
Yan, do not speak so rashly.

292
20:11.680 --> 20:13.920
Yan, don't think like that.

293
20:13.920 --> 20:16.200
Father has always favored you the most.

294
20:16.200 --> 20:18.619
If not for your legs...

295
20:19.960 --> 20:21.240
Xi misspoke.

296
20:21.240 --> 20:24.140
I apologize on her behalf.

297
20:29.839 --> 20:31.500
Done with the ledger?

298
20:36.000 --> 20:38.640
Sir, was this debt incurred entirely by him alone?

299
20:38.640 --> 20:41.640
Exactly. Honesty is everything in business.

300
20:41.640 --> 20:44.980
Not one coin short, not one coin extra.

301
20:48.011 --> 20:49.400
Let me ask you this.

302
20:49.400 --> 20:51.640
How much can one spend at Shuyu Pavilion

303
20:51.640 --> 20:53.720
in a single visit?

304
20:53.720 --> 20:55.680
Accompanied by the top courtesan,

305
20:55.680 --> 20:57.599
imperial tribute tea and wine,

306
20:57.599 --> 20:59.599
and full musical entertainment tips,

307
20:59.599 --> 21:03.920
with extra tips included, 10 taels at most.

308
21:03.920 --> 21:06.799
Which means, even going to Shuyu Pavilion every day

309
21:06.799 --> 21:08.799
and spending 10 taels each time,

310
21:08.799 --> 21:11.960
the cost for half a year would only be 1,800 taels.

311
21:11.960 --> 21:14.920
Where did 1,879 taels and 6 fen come from?

312
21:14.920 --> 21:18.059
Besides, who could go every day?

313
21:18.960 --> 21:21.500
No one's body could take that.

314
21:25.799 --> 21:30.440
The tab is under Master Yan's name, so it counts as his debt alone.

315
21:30.440 --> 21:33.160
Beyond that, I know nothing.

316
21:33.160 --> 21:36.640
So there are other expenses charged to him as well.

317
21:36.640 --> 21:38.720
You just said honesty is everything,

318
21:38.720 --> 21:40.000
so why leave that out?

319
21:40.000 --> 21:43.900
Since you're hiding something, I can't acknowledge this debt yet.

320
21:46.119 --> 21:48.880
Shuyu Pavilion's bookkeepers are second to none.

321
21:48.880 --> 21:50.119
Check if you like,

322
21:50.119 --> 21:53.039
but my shopkeeper is pressing hard.

323
21:53.039 --> 21:55.740
The money is due today.

324
21:56.359 --> 21:57.640
This is interesting.

325
21:57.640 --> 22:01.599
You didn't ask for over half a year, yet you demand it today.

326
22:01.599 --> 22:03.559
I'm just an errand man.

327
22:03.559 --> 22:06.359
Then please ask your shopkeeper for some leeway.

328
22:06.359 --> 22:08.799
Whatever Master Yan owes,

329
22:08.799 --> 22:12.539
we will repay in full within seven days.

330
22:15.243 --> 22:18.960
So she's the Xie family's pillar of strength.

331
22:18.960 --> 22:21.460
She seems quite approachable.

332
22:22.457 --> 22:23.957
Mother.

333
22:25.720 --> 22:27.380
Everyone, be seated.

334
22:30.359 --> 22:31.640
Of course.

335
22:31.640 --> 22:33.720
My shopkeeper made it clear beforehand.

336
22:33.720 --> 22:36.440
If the Matriarch says it will be repaid,

337
22:36.440 --> 22:40.960
we'll wait seven months, let alone seven days.

338
22:40.960 --> 22:44.980
I heard most of it from the back.

339
22:47.000 --> 22:48.500
Lady Jin.

340
22:53.759 --> 22:55.539
Showing off.

341
22:56.279 --> 22:58.079
You're good with words and numbers,

342
22:58.079 --> 23:01.859
so you're the perfect person for this.

343
23:03.559 --> 23:05.539
Would you be willing?

344
23:16.440 --> 23:17.839
[Ying Tao] This is Ying Tao.

345
23:17.839 --> 23:19.186
[Maid of the Xie Family] She grew up under Matron Fang

346
23:19.186 --> 23:20.839
and serves in the manor.

347
23:20.839 --> 23:24.799
Don't be fooled by her age. She's an experienced hand.

348
23:24.799 --> 23:27.880
The Xie manor has many rules, unlike the outside world.

349
23:27.880 --> 23:29.599
Since you're newly arrived,

350
23:29.599 --> 23:33.259
feel free to ask her anything you don't understand.

351
23:39.880 --> 23:41.119
Thank you, Matriarch.

352
23:41.119 --> 23:44.019
I... I'll remember as your granddaughter-in-law.

353
23:44.839 --> 23:47.039
If you wish to go out, Lady Jin,

354
23:47.039 --> 23:49.519
[Matron Fang] remember to inform Ying Tao first.

355
23:49.519 --> 23:52.099
[Steward of the Xie Family] You must never act on your own.

356
24:00.496 --> 24:03.440
[Zhendianxi Hall]

357
24:03.440 --> 24:04.960
She's been here half a day,

358
24:04.960 --> 24:07.279
and Grandmother's assigned a maid to her.

359
24:07.279 --> 24:08.519
Even I never had one!

360
24:08.519 --> 24:09.839
How is that fair?

361
24:09.839 --> 24:11.200
A mere concubine!

362
24:11.200 --> 24:12.400
- A village girl! - Enough.

363
24:12.400 --> 24:14.599
Enough, Xi.

364
24:14.599 --> 24:16.519
Put down those flowers and shears.

365
24:16.519 --> 24:18.599
If you hurt your hand, it'll look bad.

366
24:18.599 --> 24:20.079
Come here. Come.

367
24:20.079 --> 24:21.200
Come to me.

368
24:21.200 --> 24:23.079
Let me see. Come here.

369
24:23.079 --> 24:24.519
- Mama... - Come, give me your hand.

370
24:24.519 --> 24:26.920
Grandmother is biased toward the main branch!

371
24:26.920 --> 24:28.000
He's just a cripple!

372
24:28.000 --> 24:29.400
Kindness will go to waste!

373
24:29.400 --> 24:30.680
- I really don't understand! - Yes, you're right.

374
24:30.680 --> 24:31.880
I don't understand!

375
24:31.880 --> 24:33.680
Why don't you shout even louder

376
24:33.680 --> 24:36.519
and summon all the maids and ladies from other branches,

377
24:36.519 --> 24:39.119
so they can see how the young lady of our branch

378
24:39.119 --> 24:41.579
makes a complete fool of herself?

379
24:42.759 --> 24:45.327
I wanted to find a timid girl from a modest family,

380
24:45.327 --> 24:47.160
yet you insisted on a village girl.

381
24:47.160 --> 24:48.400
You saw it today.

382
24:48.400 --> 24:51.180
That sharp tongue of hers never backs down.

383
24:51.799 --> 24:55.106
She's going to be impossible to deal with in the future.

384
24:55.106 --> 24:57.819
So you're blaming me, Mama?

385
24:59.640 --> 25:02.119
How could I, my dear?

386
25:02.119 --> 25:04.160
You are my backbone.

387
25:04.160 --> 25:06.480
It's all thanks to your strategies

388
25:06.480 --> 25:08.559
that I took over the household.

389
25:08.559 --> 25:12.200
That's why the three of us have a good life today.

390
25:12.200 --> 25:13.720
- All right. - Took over?

391
25:13.720 --> 25:15.359
All right.

392
25:15.359 --> 25:18.119
A gentleman never takes what belongs to others.

393
25:18.119 --> 25:19.920
Not take.

394
25:19.920 --> 25:22.000
Zhou Wan Jun just isn't meant to have it.

395
25:22.000 --> 25:25.059
She's frail and sickly, so she gives it up herself.

396
25:27.240 --> 25:30.160
Internal strife invites external trouble.

397
25:30.160 --> 25:33.160
Xie Yan is stagnant water right now,

398
25:33.160 --> 25:35.680
which only makes Father and Grandmother pity him.

399
25:35.680 --> 25:39.500
Better to stir the waters before we make our move.

400
25:41.839 --> 25:43.640
I see now.

401
25:43.640 --> 25:46.720
You wanted me to find someone of low status,

402
25:46.720 --> 25:50.200
knowing the main branch would resent her and make things hard,

403
25:50.200 --> 25:51.680
just like today.

404
25:51.680 --> 25:55.119
She forced that ledger onto the village girl.

405
25:55.119 --> 25:57.299
Could the village girl be happy?

406
25:58.039 --> 26:01.079
It gives us the perfect opportunity to win her over.

407
26:01.079 --> 26:03.599
I really don't know what you're so pleased about.

408
26:03.599 --> 26:07.220
Don't you realize you've already botched half the plan?

409
26:07.920 --> 26:09.279
What is the Xie family?

410
26:09.279 --> 26:13.000
A mere clerk dared to barge into the main hall demanding debts!

411
26:13.000 --> 26:14.799
Isn't it ridiculous?

412
26:14.799 --> 26:17.000
- I... - If not for your sloppy management,

413
26:17.000 --> 26:19.160
it was deliberate.

414
26:19.160 --> 26:21.200
You gave yourself away.

415
26:21.200 --> 26:22.920
Good thing I intervened.

416
26:22.920 --> 26:26.900
Or how would you answer if Zhou Wan Jun demanded an explanation?

417
26:27.519 --> 26:30.759
Grandmother reminded Lady Jin of the rules today,

418
26:30.759 --> 26:33.319
and you thought she was completely oblivious?

419
26:33.319 --> 26:36.339
Let me tell you. That was an indirect jab at you!

420
26:37.160 --> 26:39.680
Then... Then what should we do?

421
26:39.680 --> 26:41.400
Go see someone right now,

422
26:41.400 --> 26:45.240
and see another after the seven days are up.

423
26:45.240 --> 26:47.039
- Me? - Qiao,

424
26:47.039 --> 26:48.599
what can I do, then?

425
26:48.599 --> 26:51.160
Just wait, Mama.

426
26:51.160 --> 26:53.119
What's the rush?

427
26:53.119 --> 26:56.339
Someone else is far more anxious than we are.

428
27:08.880 --> 27:10.539
Almost done packing?

429
27:14.400 --> 27:16.799
Ming Pei came by to urge me,

430
27:16.799 --> 27:20.259
telling me to move to Master Yan's courtyard today.

431
27:21.839 --> 27:24.400
I know very well you don't want to go,

432
27:24.400 --> 27:26.640
but the Matriarch has already decided.

433
27:26.640 --> 27:28.539
What else can we do?

434
27:31.240 --> 27:33.319
I don't blame anyone.

435
27:33.319 --> 27:35.279
I just lack the fortune

436
27:35.279 --> 27:37.740
to serve the Matriarch.

437
27:38.519 --> 27:42.200
Once you're over there, talk less and do more.

438
27:42.200 --> 27:45.759
Remember, keep your eyes open, and your ears peeled.

439
27:45.759 --> 27:47.259
Understood?

440
27:54.119 --> 27:55.619
Take this.

441
27:57.119 --> 27:58.619
You should go.

442
28:22.559 --> 28:23.920
What?

443
28:23.920 --> 28:26.480
No energy to sort out accounts,

444
28:26.480 --> 28:28.539
but plenty of it to rage at me?

445
28:29.240 --> 28:31.400
I want you to apologize.

446
28:31.400 --> 28:34.079
Since you know the debt isn't mine,

447
28:34.079 --> 28:35.759
what did I do wrong?

448
28:35.759 --> 28:37.200
Why should I apologize?

449
28:37.200 --> 28:38.640
You knew it and kept quiet?

450
28:38.640 --> 28:40.119
You just watched unhurriedly

451
28:40.119 --> 28:41.599
and left the fallout to me.

452
28:41.599 --> 28:43.640
Even a butchered pig knows to squeal.

453
28:43.640 --> 28:45.759
You're worse than a pig!

454
28:45.759 --> 28:47.559
Attend to the duties of your post.

455
28:47.559 --> 28:49.599
Who told you to rush into marrying in?

456
28:49.599 --> 28:51.799
Did you really think pie falls from the sky?

457
28:51.799 --> 28:53.299
Keep dreaming.

458
28:54.880 --> 28:56.740
Glamorous from afar,

459
28:57.519 --> 28:59.519
but the stench hits you up close.

460
28:59.519 --> 29:02.700
Only then do you know how filthy noble mansions are.

461
29:04.519 --> 29:07.119
That's what I call all style and no substance.

462
29:07.119 --> 29:09.920
Understood, little firecracker?

463
29:09.920 --> 29:11.599
You can't handle your own trouble,

464
29:11.599 --> 29:12.920
yet scold me like Father.

465
29:12.920 --> 29:13.920
Have you no shame?

466
29:13.920 --> 29:16.480
All those books went to waste on you. Apologize!

467
29:16.480 --> 29:18.440
Books taught me to tell right from wrong,

468
29:18.440 --> 29:21.480
not to indulge an unreasonable shrew.

469
29:21.480 --> 29:23.480
It's clearly your own foolishness.

470
29:23.480 --> 29:25.400
I'm making you apologize to me today!

471
29:25.400 --> 29:27.640
You're asking for it!

472
29:27.640 --> 29:29.000
You...

473
29:29.000 --> 29:30.700
I'll never apologize today.

474
29:32.240 --> 29:34.599
Not only are you going to apologize today,

475
29:34.599 --> 29:37.220
you're going to bow your head and do it.

476
29:56.480 --> 29:58.480
It's all right.

477
29:58.480 --> 30:00.180
Save the fake concern.

478
30:01.640 --> 30:04.680
I worried that knocking your head would make you stupider.

479
30:04.680 --> 30:07.440
People call a fool like you a great scholar.

480
30:07.440 --> 30:09.039
What a waste of my life!

481
30:09.039 --> 30:10.319
You're virtuous.

482
30:10.319 --> 30:11.680
You alone are unstained.

483
30:11.680 --> 30:13.880
Stop blabbering nonsense. I don't understand a word.

484
30:13.880 --> 30:15.380
Thanks for the compliment.

485
30:24.519 --> 30:25.559
I can't read.

486
30:25.559 --> 30:26.720
You read. I calculate.

487
30:26.720 --> 30:28.119
I'm bad with brushes.

488
30:28.119 --> 30:29.619
Any charcoal?

489
30:36.512 --> 30:40.852
[Moonlit Radiance]

490
30:42.519 --> 30:44.079
Ying Tao, it hurts.

491
30:44.079 --> 30:46.319
Dozing off in broad daylight?

492
30:46.319 --> 30:48.220
Is this how you serve?

493
30:49.680 --> 30:51.200
Forgive me.

494
30:51.200 --> 30:55.029
My legs almost gave out fetching charcoal just now.

495
30:55.029 --> 30:58.119
I couldn't help taking a brief nap.

496
30:58.119 --> 31:00.759
Serving your masters is your duty.

497
31:00.759 --> 31:02.938
Stop playing the victim.

498
31:02.938 --> 31:04.438
Go wash your face.

499
31:15.720 --> 31:17.220
Miss Xi.

500
31:18.279 --> 31:19.559
This tea is refreshing.

501
31:19.559 --> 31:22.720
I'm delivering it to Yan and that village...

502
31:22.720 --> 31:24.500
Lady Jin.

503
31:28.640 --> 31:32.400
You've been promoted to Lady Jin's first-rank maid.

504
31:32.400 --> 31:34.240
That's great news.

505
31:34.240 --> 31:37.920
My mother prepared this cup of tea specially for you

506
31:37.920 --> 31:39.539
as a gift.

507
31:40.759 --> 31:43.000
Thank you for your and Lady Qin's kindness.

508
31:43.000 --> 31:44.559
I appreciate the thought,

509
31:44.559 --> 31:47.140
but I dare not accept this tea.

510
31:48.960 --> 31:52.799
I heard that when you prepared tea for Grandmother with Matron Fang,

511
31:52.799 --> 31:56.039
you often brewed her leftover tea dregs.

512
31:56.039 --> 31:59.200
Now you refuse a proper cup of tea.

513
31:59.200 --> 32:04.220
Do you think these tea leaves are worse than her tea dregs?
